and  democrats  came out after of course all the  spotlight's been on joe manchin this  week  and said  we're going to play hardball with him  next year  yep  joe biden president joe biden says he is  not done with his talks with joe manchin  this isn't over they're going to  continue on with this chuck schumer says  we're going to play hardball  with joe manchin  we're going to make this thing happen  and they're gonna start putting pressure  on him  and that's what's been needed this whole  time i want everybody to think for a  second  in terms of in the senate  who are the people you have seen  publicly come out  and call out joe manchin who are sitting  in the senate today well not today  they're on vacation but you know what i  mean  who  chuck schumer has  bernie sanders has  pretty sure elizabeth warren has  it's three  three out of three out of 50  that i know of  now that's not to say they're the only  three  sure plenty of other folks could have  flown under the radar maybe their  statements their comments didn't quite  get the attention that the comments of  these other folks had  but why  and bernie sanders made headlines for a  day and a half last week by saying joe  manchin and kirsten sinema were acting  like republicans  but part of the pressure campaign that  has to be put on joe manchin the hard  ball the democrats say they're gonna  play  means that it can't just be bernie  sanders they can't just send bernie out  to be the attack dog and then later on  be like well he's not really a democrat  so that's why he can do it no  bernie sanders is more of a democrat  than joe manchin could ever hope to be  in his life trust me  in fact he's more of a democrat than any  of the democrats in that synod but  either way  you can't just have one guy you can't  have three people  elizabeth warren is tough she is  absolutely  just  an attack person  and a passionate person and i love  elizabeth warren  but that's also not enough  there has to be this united front  and that's what the democratic party has  been lacking  you know sure you're not going to get  cinema to join in on the attacks on joe  manchin to to really pressure him you're  not going to get  tester to do it either  but you can get a handful  you know 10 to 15 other  democratic senators to band together  and go public with this and that's what  you have to do  it can't just be one guy doing an  interview here elizabeth warren doing an  interview over here and you know making  passing comments about joe manchin and  both of them and then the interviewer  moves on to something else that's not  good enough  it has to be press conferences  it has to be meetings  and then after the meetings you have to  do another press conference and talk  about how he wouldn't  go along with what you needed and how  much that's going to harm the people of  the united states  those are the points you hit on  you don't just talk about oh everybody's  going to suffer by this no say listen  because of this man obstructing this  legislation you don't get that child tax  credit money in your bank every month  anymore  because of his decision here we're not  going to have  child care expenses paid for for you  we're not going to have lower cost  prescription prescription drugs we're  not going to have the 35 insulin that's  a part of the legislation  we're not going to transition to  renewable energy we're going to keep  burning the dirty fossil fuels  that's the message you go forward with  but you have to go forward with it  with as united of a front as you can put  together  it can't be a piecemeal patchwork of one  senator over here on msnbc saying it  went on cnn saying it and then nobody  talks about it for another month no  and you can't put it all on joe biden  either  it can't just be manchin and biden  talking again no  it has to be everybody everywhere every  time all the time  going after him and playing hardball so  again the democrats say  they're going to play hardball with joe  manchin in 2022 and i am here for it all  day long  but you have to do it right  you can't just come across as a bunch of  bullies who are mad at mansion  put the real pressure on him remind the  public of what's at stake  and eventually if you're united and  strong  you might just be able to crack him  i'm farron cousins you can find me on  youtube at youtube.com fair and balanced  youtube.com  the ring of fire and ring of fire  podcast at rofpodcast.com  i'll be right back with more on the  david pakman show

